{"id":782648,"imdb":"tt11897340","en":"Huda's Salon","orig":"صالون هدى","ar":null,"tag":"Some betrayals you don't live to regret.","ov":"Based on real events, Huda’s Salon is a heart-racing, entertaining feminist thriller, where two women fight for their freedom. Reem, a young mother who is married to a jealous man, goes to Huda’s salon in Bethlehem for a haircut and an attentive ear. However, this ordinary visit turns sour after Huda puts Reem in a shameful situation, blackmails her to work for the secret service of the occupiers and betrays her people.","rd":"2022-03-04","rt":91,"g":[53],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Film Clinic","logo":"/wiYuQiEr15YGdedQP1h9vzsGXVf.png","c":"EG"},{"n":"MAD Solutions","logo":"/stD0eT3eNqWRzex8iwklTN2txu7.png","c":"EG"},{"n":"Key Film Productions","logo":null,"c":"IT"},{"n":"H&A Production","logo":null,"c":""},{"n":"Lagoonie Film Production","logo":"/9Bc2upRaLIrbGvasOeBDwRW99lt.png","c":"EG"},{"n":"Memento Films International","logo":"/2JOR75Gaz14Vzim0XSTSCmGFYsD.png","c":"FR"}],"countries":["PS","EG","NL","QA"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"CA","d":"2021-09-09"},{"c":"KR","d":"2021-10-07"},{"c":"NL","d":"2022-03-04"},{"c":"US","d":"2022-03-04"},{"c":"GR","d":"2022-10-27"},{"c":"FR","d":"2023-02-01"}],"dir":["Hany Abu-Assad"],"prod":["Mohamed Hefzy","Amira Diab","Hany Abu-Assad","Sawsan Asfari"],"wri":["Hany Abu-Assad"],"mus":["Jeffrey van Rossum"],"dop":["Ehab Assal","Peter Flinckenberg"],"cast":[{"n":"Maisa Abd Elhadi","ch":"Reem","p":"/oB1GjX3FcVjvmFa4casNGc7XR6f.jpg"},{"n":"Ali Suliman","ch":"Hasan","p":"/fG9V68oshqkuDSSRkLZdCci6z1Q.jpg"},{"n":"Manal Awad","ch":"Huda","p":null},{"n":"Jalal Masarwa","ch":"Yousef","p":"/65s9EAefQ51hdt4UV4QoRRE9ZeC.jpg"},{"n":"Omar Abu Amer","ch":"Noor","p":null},{"n":"Samer Bisharat","ch":"Said","p":"/7lbALxM4kOFFu3OVezgTNP6sJqg.jpg"},{"n":"Kamel El Basha","ch":"Doctor","p":"/k1U16QD78Kn0JsvPsPKJn4dP18S.jpg"},{"n":"Angham Khalil","ch":"Eza","p":"/tAjayqeNgEAvv